t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"kb-global-loading\"></div>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"kb-global-results\"></section>\n\n\t\t\t<button class=\"hide-text visible-desktop kb-global__btn-close\" id=\"KBStickyClose\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\">Close</button>\n\n\t\t</aside>\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</header>\n\n\n    \n\n    \n    \n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"container typography layout\" id=\"layout\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n\t<section class=\"span9 mainContent\">\n\t\t\n\t<ul class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<li><a href=\"\">Home</a> <span class=\"divider\">/</span></li>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/tuhono-connect/\">T\u016bhono\u2502Connect</a> <span class=\"divider\">/</span></li>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"active\">Our newsletter, Privacy News</li>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t</ul>\n    \n\n\n\t\t<h1 class=\"print-only\">T\u016bhono\u2502Connect</h1>\n\t\t<header class=\"page-header subhead\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"pull-right printShare\">\n\t<a href=\"\" onclick=\"window.print(); return false;\">Print</a>\n\n\t\n\n\t| <a href=\"mailto:?subject=From%20the%20Privacy%20Commissioner%20website%3A%20Our%20newsletter%2C%20Privacy%20News&amp;body=I%20thought%20that%20you%20might%20be%20interested%20in%20this%20page%20from%20the%20Privacy%20Commissioner%27s%20website.%0A%0AOur%20newsletter%2C%20Privacy%20News%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.privacy.org.nz%2Ftuhono-connect%2Fprivacy-news%2F\" title=\"Email this page\">\n\t\tEmail this page\n\t</a>\n\n</p>\n\n\t\t\t<h2>Our newsletter, Privacy News</h2>\n\t\t</header>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p>At the end of each month, we send our newsletter, Privacy News, to 5,000 people interested in privacy issues. If that\u2019s you too, <a href=\"/subscribe/\">sign up to have it delivered to your inbox for free</a>.<br><br>If you have content to share, or questions about Privacy News, please <a href=\"mailto:commsteam@privacy.org.nz?subject=Let&#039;s%20korero%20about%20Privacy%20News\">email our communications team</a>. We try to keep a year's back issues on the website but email us if you're looking for something older.</p>\n<h2>Recent issues</h2>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.007%; height: 1185.55px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 33.0935%;\"><col style=\"width: 66.8868%;\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 39.4444px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 39.4444px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/3ba4c9bf61e4/privacy-news\" target=\"_blank\">Read the July 2026 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 39.4444px;\">\n<p>Read about employee browsing, our new corporate reports, the Policing Amendment Bill, and how you can come work with us.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/4c60572c8647/privacy-news-may-14046973?e=29a1773437#Read%20the%20June%202026%20issue%20of%20Privacy%20News\" target=\"_blank\">Read the June 2026 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>What\u2019s the difference between a privacy statement, notice and policy? HIPC) Rule 3A, Breach legal professional privilege updated, phishing and credential theft dominate quarterly reports.&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/aec774458382/privacy-news-may\" target=\"_blank\">Read the May 2026 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about the results of our 2026 privacy survey, the results of our inquiry into the Manage My Health privacy breach, Privacy Week webinar recordings, and more.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/b5f0459be26d/privacy-news-november-14046043\" target=\"_blank\">Read the April 2026 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Privacy Week programme announced, our submission on the Police Amendment Bill, IPP3A - tomorrow is the big day, Facebook group fined for privacy failure</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/0e7511ae8ebc/privacy-news-november-14045599\" target=\"_blank\">Read the March 2026 issue of Privacy Newa</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Privacy Week 2026, new IPP3A video, multi-agency meeting guidance, education sector guidance, lost USB stick constitutes notifiable privacy breach, latest credit reporting.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/b62282213c5d/privacy-news-november-14045358\" target=\"_blank\">Read the February 2026 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about how we're changing the way we respond to public enquiries, the Sir Bruce Slane Memorial Lecture, Privacy Week speaker applications open, and joint statement on AI generated imagery.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/df553fbad6ff/privacy-news-november\" target=\"_blank\">Read the November 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about our new guidance on information sharing and keeping children safe, our IPP3A guidance, the dates for Privacy Week, and new privacy posters.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/d29e5c58db55/privacy-news-october\" target=\"_blank\">Read the October 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>This issue includes a reminder about the Biometric Processing Privacy Code, information sharing for children's safety, the Commissioner's learnings from the GPA, and more.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/869703d48690/privacy-news-august-14042956\" target=\"_blank\">Read the September 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<p>The Privacy Amendment Act passes into law, joint statement on trustworthy Data Governance for AI, walls of shame, Right to Know Day, Cyber Smart Week is coming, and learn how to create your privacy training plan with Poupou Matatapu.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/dd1ea6078137/privacy-news-august\" target=\"_blank\">Read the August 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 82.3611px;\">\n<p>Read about the Biometrics Code, the Device Location Information (DLI) service, and a new Compliance Comment we've published. Our privacy tool, Poupou Matatapu, has also been shortlisted for one of the Global Privacy and Data Protection Awards.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/5ff781f5d562/privacy-news-july\" target=\"_blank\">Read the July 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about how to consult effectively with us, our new decision notes, and an update on the Biometrics Code. We also share an article about disposing of old technology, and our media release about better passwords.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/6b0cd4ef2bf0/privacy-news-june-2025\" target=\"_blank\">Read the June 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>In the June issue you can read about the FRT Inquiry results, the APPA 63 Forum, two new case notes published on our site, and new and updated guidance about the HIPC.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/32d7864924fe/privacy-news-april-14040844\" target=\"_blank\">Read the May 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about our Children's Privacy Project, two open consultation processes, how we did on Privacy Week, a Compliance Notice for Oranga Tamariki, our latest Privacy Survey and more.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/605f556b0570/privacy-news-april\" target=\"_blank\">Read the April 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 60.9028px;\">\n<p>Read about our Privacy Week 2025 lineup and resources, IPP3A guidance and how to have your say, and new tips for using AI to contact OPC.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/0ec1a6a42997/privacy-news-february-12824038\" target=\"_blank\">Read the March 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p>This issue includes a note that the Biometric Code consultation has now closed, and that the final version of the Code will likely be published mid-2025. It also includes policy advice for government agencies, Kordia research and what OPC said about that, the Global Privacy Assembly's new comparison tables, and the delay of the UK's adequacy review. We also announce a special guest for Privacy Week 2025.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/b54813cb5480/privacy-news-february\" target=\"_blank\">Read the February 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p>The February 2025 issue of Privacy News includes a reminder about giving feedback on the Biometrics Code, a piece about the Public Services Commission and Stats NZ reports, how to apply to speak in Privacy Week 2025, and new guidance for tenants and landlords on our website. You can also read about the EU Guidelines and task force on AI, and a note about privacy.org.nz being updated.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p><a title=\"Open this issue in a new tab.\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://mailchi.mp/8f246c05c8d6/privacy-news-january-biometrics-code-mori-reference-panel-new-case-note\" target=\"_blank\">Read the January 2025 issue of Privacy News</a></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 103.819px;\">\n<p>The first Privacy News of 2025 covers the release of the Biometrics Code and how to give feedback on this, a new case note about personal information being published to a website, and the introduction of OPC's M\u0101ori reference panel. There is also a notice about new translations of our privacy brochures - we now offer them in Traditional and Simplified Chinese, and Vietnamese.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\t\n<div role=\"complementary\" class=\"span3 sidebar\">\n\t<div class=\"sidebar-nav sidebar-device\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"sidenav-title\">T\u016bhono\u2502Connect</h2>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"nav nav-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- second level pages -->\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"link \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/tuhono-connect/stat